#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: eventadmin-volunteer-management.php includes/admin/dashboard-menu.php:246
msgid "EventAdmin – Volunteer Management"
msgstr "EventAdmin – Volunteer Management"

#. Description of the plugin
#: eventadmin-volunteer-management.php
msgid ""
"Manage volunteers for events directly in WordPress. Create and schedule "
"shifts, allow volunteers to sign up and cancel independently, and configure "
"individual rules – e.g., maximum shifts per person per year."
msgstr ""
"Verwalte Volunteers für Veranstaltungen direkt in WordPress. Erstelle und "
"plane Schichten, ermögliche Volunteers die selbstständige Anmeldung und "
"Stornierung und konfiguriere individuelle Regeln – z. B. maximale Schichten "
"pro Person und Jahr."

#. Author of the plugin
