#~ msgid ""
#~ "Open Shifts → Overview. In the Table view use the \"Add volunteer\" button "
#~ "on a shift, or click an open slot in the Timeline view. You can pick an "
#~ "existing volunteer or create a new account (with or without an email "
#~ "address) on the spot."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Öffne Schichten → Übersicht. Nutze in der Ansicht „Tabelle“ die Schaltfläche"
